<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">VOIDSCAR ARENA · MYTHIC+ · ELEMENTAL SHAMAN</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">元素萨满</span><span class="dot">·</span>虚空之痕竞技场 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">虚空之痕竞技场的压力来自<b>长时间全团持续伤害</b>：几丁高斯险恶光环、塔兹拉尔空灵冲刺、阿特洛苏斯剧毒光环、残虐者恐惧咆哮与煞戎努斯星辰坠击。元素萨满没有免疫，90 秒<b>星界转移</b>按这几处固定点排开，<b>土元素</b>（始源羁绊，最大生命值 +15%）补空档轮；<b>风剪</b>盯紧熔岩箭、愈体虚空与暗影箭雨，连带门前怪时开尾王前<b>妖术</b>一只野蛮裂爪兽。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+24 限时元素萨满（国 / 欧）</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>先知</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-scroll">
      <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
      <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#s1">开场</a>
      <a href="#s2"><span class="n">①</span>塔兹拉尔</a>
      <a href="#s3">熔岩区</a>
      <a href="#s4"><span class="n">②</span>阿特洛苏斯</a>
      <a href="#s5">虚空区</a>
      <a href="#s6"><span class="n">③</span>煞戎努斯</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <p class="sub">四张手牌管住全本，外加一条机制硬限制与五组必断读条。</p>

  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:108271}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">星界转移</div><div class="cd">90 秒（位面旅行者）· 持续 12 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>所有伤害 −40%。全本唯一大减伤，专交五处长时间持续伤害，跳伤越长越值。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:198103}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">土元素</div><div class="cd">3 分钟 · 持续 30 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>配始源羁绊不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%。补星界空档：塔兹拉尔与煞戎努斯星界冷却中的那一轮。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:57994}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">风剪</div><div class="cd">12 秒 · 风幕：受到法伤 −15%</div></div></div>
      <p>30 码打断，之后 12 秒受法术伤害 −15%。按队伍分工断下方读条，愈体虚空是引导，起手就断。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:192058}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">电能图腾</div><div class="cd">1 分钟（静电充能可缩短）· 晕 3 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>成堆小怪的群控补断：几丁高斯区的迅猛龙与三叶虫、虚空区的尖啸者与残虐者堆。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="limit">
    <div class="h">没有免疫 · 两记大单发靠抬血与团减</div>
    塔兹拉尔<b>黑暗绽放</b>（约 92 万暗影）与阿特洛苏斯<b>巨响咆哮</b>（约 73 万无视护甲物理）每轮都打全团。星界转移优先留给持续伤害，这两下要提前抬血或配团减；巨响咆哮是物理，风幕减不了。
  </div>

  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head">
      <img class="ic" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="风剪">
      <h3>全本必断读条与引导</h3>
      <span>点击跳到对应战斗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-roar">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">01</span><span>被统御的斗士 · 开场 / 尾王</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">挫志怒吼</div>
        <div class="why">4 秒 100 码读条，斗士反复读，开怪第一个断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-sand">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">02</span><span>暴怒的三叶虫 · 开场</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">狂暴之沙</div>
        <div class="why">60 码全团自然伤害加 12 秒减速 40%，必断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-lava">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">03</span><span>被奴役的萨满 / 尖啸者 · 熔岩区</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">熔岩箭 / 疯狂尖啸</div>
        <div class="why">萨满一直读熔岩箭；尖啸者漏断全队恐惧 6 秒。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-heal">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">04</span><span>虚空看顾者 · 虚空区</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">愈体虚空</div>
        <div class="why">可断引导，起手立刻断，拖久残虐者回血可能多吃一轮咆哮。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-volley">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">05</span><span>虚触法师 · 虚空区</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">暗影箭雨</div>
        <div class="why">60 码全团暗影，优先断，缺断提前报。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里减伤交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一场 +24 限时实录，摘录主要减伤（展示真实冷却节奏，非每波强制照搬；具体取舍见下方路线）。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>星界转移</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>土元素</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。带「必做」标签的高亮行是每把必做的关键动作。伤害数字是 +24 实测（含被吸收的部分），层数越高越大。</p>

  <div class="route">

    <!-- 开场 → 塔兹拉尔 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 塔兹拉尔</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 被统御的斗士 / 不屈的埃吉拉 / 鲁莽监督者 / 几丁高斯 / 布鲁托克 / 暴怒的三叶虫 / 暴怒的迅猛龙</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>开场埃吉拉一段靠治疗，<b>星界转移留给几丁高斯首轮险恶光环</b>；监督者起盾就集火，怪拉离乌龟。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-roar">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298899}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">挫志怒吼</div><div class="s">被统御的斗士 · 4 秒读条 · 100 码</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">斗士会反复读，按分工轮断，轮到就风剪并续上风幕。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298917}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">勇士之矛 / 野蛮猛击</div><div class="s">不屈的埃吉拉 · 长矛链住全队每秒约 13 万 · 落点 6 码约 41 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">先打掉长矛，躲开猛击落点</span></div>
            <div class="why">长矛不碎全队一直掉血并被拉近；被野蛮猛击锁定就带离人群，落地后 6 秒地面别站。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1250695}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>险恶光环</div><div class="s">几丁高斯 · 8 秒每 2 秒全团约 43 万自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">兜底</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">首轮光环第一跳前开星界，12 秒盖满四跳；其余轮次喊治疗，土元素闲着可兜底。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-sand">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1249621}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">狂暴之沙 / 野性之怒</div><div class="s">三叶虫读条全团自然 · 迅猛龙激怒周围近战急速 +20%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="or">成堆</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192058}}" alt="">电能图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">狂暴之沙必断；龙群堆在坦克脚下就提前放电能图腾，2 秒后一起晕。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298901}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">残暴猛击 / 甲壳守护</div><div class="s">鲁莽监督者起盾后每 1.5 秒全团约 28 万且逐次递增 · 乌龟让附近盟友减伤 75%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">集火破盾，怪拉离乌龟</span></div>
            <div class="why">监督者盾不破猛击越来越疼，先打盾；乌龟盾期把其他怪拉出范围再打。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1234890}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">粉碎冲锋</div><div class="s">布鲁托克 · 读条后向前猛冲并击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">侧移出冲锋线</span></div>
            <div class="why">远程站侧面别站它正前方，被撞到不仅掉血还会被击退打断读条。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">险恶光环每跳吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">42.5 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:65%">27.5 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交首轮险恶光环，土元素接第二轮，风剪断斗士与三叶虫</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">下一段：塔兹拉尔 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 1 塔兹拉尔 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s2">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>塔兹拉尔</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>约 <b>35 秒</b>一轮：+6 秒虚灵之影读条 → 约 +13 秒冲刺命中 → +16 秒幽影破裂 → 约 +35 秒黑暗绽放落地。<b>星界转好就交自己那轮冲刺，之后每 3 轮一次</b>（90 秒只够隔两轮），空档挑一轮交<b>土元素</b>。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222103}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>空灵冲刺</div><div class="s">虚灵之影读条约 7 秒后冲向每名玩家 · 约 68 万 + 15 秒每秒约 18 万暗影</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">空档</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">别站在别人的冲锋线上；自己的影子冲出前约 1 秒开星界，冲击和前段跳伤一起减，冷却中的轮次喊治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300259}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">黑暗绽放</div><div class="s">+31 秒起读 · 全团约 92 万 · 裂隙上的人额外再吃一发</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">满血站离裂隙</span></div>
            <div class="why">冲刺跳伤结束几秒就是绽放，提前抬血；读条时离开虚空裂隙，两发叠加极易倒地。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1296963}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">幽影破裂 / 虚空冲击</div><div class="s">塔兹拉尔与残影落点 10 码撕开裂隙 · 点名冲击并击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:79206}}" alt="">灵魂行者的恩赐</span><span class="act-note">躲开落点</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时走出 10 码，需要边走边读就开恩赐；被冲击点名别背靠裂隙。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">空灵冲刺每秒跳伤吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">17.5 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:62%">10.8 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：避开他人冲锋线，星界每 3 轮冲刺一次，绽放前离开裂隙</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">下一段：熔岩区 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 塔兹拉尔 → 阿特洛苏斯 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s3">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>塔兹拉尔 → 阿特洛苏斯</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 被奴役的萨满 / 熔岩图腾 / 千噬兽尖啸者 / 野蛮裂爪兽 / 警惕的掠心者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>这段以打断和走位为主，<b>星界转移留进阿特洛苏斯首轮剧毒光环</b>；熔岩图腾一落就转火。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-lava">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1228176}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">熔岩箭 / 疯狂尖啸</div><div class="s">被奴役的萨满单体火焰 · 尖啸者读条 60 码恐惧 6 秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="or">补控</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192058}}" alt="">电能图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">按分工轮断，尖啸者优先；成堆时提前放电能图腾，来不及就叫队友补断。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246820}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">熔岩图腾 · 灼热岩浆</div><div class="s">被奴役的萨满放下 · 持续喷火 · 每跳约 16 万火焰</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">立刻转火图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">图腾不倒全队一直被喷，落地就用单体技能点掉再回头打怪。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1239855}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">天空打击</div><div class="s">警惕的掠心者 · 冲向一人，10 码内均摊并击飞 · 实测约 75 万/次</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">靠拢分摊</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时靠拢队友分担，人越少越疼；落地会击飞，别读长读条。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300156}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">虚空光束</div><div class="s">警惕的掠心者 · 4 秒每 0.5 秒落点 8 码约 21 万暗影</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">走出 8 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">被锁定就立刻走开，别把光束带进人群；连吃多跳可致死。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">优先：风剪断尖啸者与萨满，秒熔岩图腾，星界留给老二</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">下一段：阿特洛苏斯 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 2 阿特洛苏斯 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s4">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>阿特洛苏斯</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>约 <b>50 秒</b>一轮：+35 秒巨响咆哮读条 → 约 +42 秒剧毒蠕行者冒出放光环。<b>星界从首轮或次轮光环起开，之后隔一轮再开</b>（两轮相距约 100 秒），土元素闲着可兜底空档轮。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222692}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>巨响咆哮 → 剧毒光环</div><div class="s">咆哮全团约 73 万并召出蠕行者 · 光环每 0.5 秒约 10 万自然，蠕行者死才停</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">兜底</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">咆哮前抬血，<b>光环开始跳后尽快开星界</b>压后续跳伤，同时转火蠕行者停光环；冷却轮喊治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300351}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒液喷溅 / 毒池</div><div class="s">每 20–30 秒全团约 21 万 · 毒液团砸中额外直击加跳伤 · 落地毒池 1 分钟</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">别站毒池</span></div>
            <div class="why">躲开毒液团落点；毒池会挂急速 −30% 的麻痹药膏，读条前确认脚下干净。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1222721}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒性吐息</div><div class="s">首领朝前方吐毒雾 · 正面单发极高自然伤害</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">不站首领正面</span></div>
            <div class="why">远程站首领侧后方，读条时绝不穿过正面。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">剧毒光环每跳吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">10.3 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:60%">6.2 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：隔轮星界交剧毒光环，咆哮前满血，秒蠕行者</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">下一段：虚空区 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 阿特洛苏斯 → 煞戎努斯 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s5">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>阿特洛苏斯 → 煞戎努斯</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 贪噬残虐者 / 虚空看顾者 / 虚触法师 / 食腐虹虚魔 / 野蛮裂爪兽 / 千噬兽尖啸者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>挡路的<b>贪噬残虐者</b>每堆都读恐惧咆哮：<b>星界冷却一好就交给它</b>；末堆星界至少在开煞戎努斯前约 20 秒交，第 2 轮星辰坠击才能预开。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1252406}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>恐惧咆哮</div><div class="s">贪噬残虐者 · 约 4.5 秒读条击退全队 · 12 秒每秒约 15 万暗影</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">击退落地后尽快开星界，压住大半段跳伤；常规打断断不了，没转好提前喊治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-heal">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310324}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">愈体虚空</div><div class="s">虚空看顾者 · 可断引导 · 给残虐者 20 秒每 2 秒回 3%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">引导一出现就断，别等；拖久残虐者回血，可能多吃一轮恐惧咆哮。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-volley">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299938}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">暗影箭雨 / 虚无喷发</div><div class="s">虚触法师 · 60 码全团暗影 · 落点 10 码约 80 万 + 5 秒跳伤</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="act-note">走出喷发落点</span></div>
            <div class="why">箭雨优先断，缺断提前报；喷发读条时立刻离开 10 码，后续 5 秒地面别回。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1233398}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">疯狂尖啸 / 成堆读条</div><div class="s">尖啸者 60 码恐惧 · 与残虐者、看顾者挤在一起</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192058}}" alt="">电能图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">风剪先给看顾者与法师，尖啸者成堆时提前放电能图腾，来不及叫队友补断。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300249}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">看门者 · 吞噬</div><div class="s">挡路的残虐者不死开不了尾王 · 读条吞掉附近小怪回 50% 血并增伤 20%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">先秒它要吞的小怪</span></div>
            <div class="why">吞噬常规打断断不了，读条时集火被吞目标；风剪留给愈体虚空。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1233535}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">野蛮裂爪兽 · 撕碎防御</div><div class="s">首领门前常与煞戎努斯一起拉 · 坦克受到伤害 +20%，10 秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:51514}}" alt="">妖术</span></div>
            <div class="why">要连带门前怪时，开煞戎努斯前妖术一只裂爪兽，别用顺劈打醒。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">恐惧咆哮每秒吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">15.1 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:62%">9.4 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交恐惧咆哮，风剪看顾者与法师，开尾王前妖术裂爪兽</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s6">下一段：煞戎努斯 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 3 煞戎努斯 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>煞戎努斯</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>约 <b>53 秒</b>一轮，全程奇点每秒掉血：+5 秒奇点 → +17 秒星辰坠击读条 → +28 秒引力宝珠 → +34 秒暗影浪潮 → +43 秒虚空奔涌。<b>星界从第 2 轮起隔轮交星辰坠击</b>，第 3 轮土元素转好就交。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮技能轴（以开打为 0 秒，每 53 秒循环）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">开打</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298899}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">门前连带 · 挫志怒吼 / 疯狂尖啸</div><div class="s">连带斗士、尖啸者与裂爪兽进战（同前段）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">按分工断尖啸者与斗士，妖术的裂爪兽别打醒。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+17 秒读条</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300372}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>星辰坠击</div><div class="s">5 秒读条 → 落点 8 码约 59 万并击退 · 随后 20 秒每秒约 8 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">第 3 轮</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">散开别叠队友落点，<b>读条最后约 1 秒开星界</b>，落地与前段跳伤、奇点一起减；第 3 轮土元素没好就喊治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+28 秒读条</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310025}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">不稳定奇点 / 引力宝珠</div><div class="s">每颗奇点每秒约 4 万并往中心拉，多颗叠加 · 宝珠追人叠凝缩物质</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">把宝珠带进奇点 6 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">把宝珠带进奇点 6 码就碎，人绕边走；被吸进中心 15 秒无法攻击或用技能。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+34 / +43 秒读条</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1311923}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">暗影浪潮 / 虚空奔涌</div><div class="s">暗影能量波 · 宇宙能量光束击退 · 单发都极高</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:79206}}" alt="">灵魂行者的恩赐</span><span class="act-note">躲开</span></div>
            <div class="why">两段都要走位躲，开恩赐边走边读；别被虚空奔涌推进奇点。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">星辰坠击每秒跳伤吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">7.8 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:63%">4.9 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交第 2、4 轮星辰坠击，土元素补第 3 轮，宝珠带进奇点</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +24 限时录像的元素天赋，英雄天赋先知。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这四个防御与功能天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:381647}}" alt=""><div><b>位面旅行者</b><span>星界转移冷却缩到 90 秒，塔兹拉尔每 3 轮、阿特洛苏斯与煞戎努斯隔轮才排得开。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1279819}}" alt=""><div><b>始源羁绊</b><span>土元素不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%，专补星界空档轮。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:355630}}" alt=""><div><b>风幕</b><span>风剪打断后 12 秒受到的法术伤害 −15%，全本大部分持续伤害是暗影与自然。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:192058}}" alt=""><div><b>电能图腾</b><span>几丁高斯区龙群与虚空区尖啸者成堆读条时的群控补断。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见可换：<b>阵风、喷流、静电充能、图腾集中、图腾潮涌、清毒图腾</b> ↔ <b>幽魂步、大地之盾、元素环绕、塞拉赞恩的韧性、奥拉基尔之风、治疗链</b>。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>元素萨满 · 虚空之痕竞技场 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/B6nk2TZhgqPxDFfb#fight=1">小奈电下 +24 29:10</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/GmjDn46rYhbKHzfw#fight=47">坦克不许动 +24 29:34</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/1dCwc4LGmknFb2VA#fight=1">孤独咩 +24 29:34</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/h82XJKQYxVztdnqv#fight=1">Freaksh +24 29:39</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/BYn7F2LfDwN8xkzq#fight=24">我要退休了 +24 29:42</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
